Weekdays: 30 minutes * (7 days) = 210 minutes = 3.5 hours
Weekends: 210 minutes + 120 minutes = 330 minutes = 5.5 hours 
Total: 3.5 hours + 5.5 hours = 9 hours 
Total hours: 9 hours * 52 weeks = 468 hours 

